Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Subscription Not Syncing
Symptoms: Subscription shows as created but applications are not deployed to target clusters.

Solutions:

Verify cluster labels match placement rule selectors
Check GitHub repository accessibility
Verify Git secret if using private repository
Check subscription path configuration
# Debug commands
kubectl describe subscription nginx-app-dev-subscription -n gitops-lab-apps
kubectl get managedclusters --show-labels
kubectl describe placementrule dev-placement -n gitops-lab-apps
Issue 2: ArgoCD Application Out of Sync
Symptoms: ArgoCD shows application as "OutOfSync" or "Unknown".

Solutions:

Check repository connectivity
Verify path exists in repository
Manual sync from ArgoCD UI
Check ArgoCD application controller logs
# Manual sync via CLI
kubectl patch application nginx-app-dev -n argocd --type merge -p '{"operation":{"sync":{"revision":"HEAD"}}}'
Issue 3: Different Replica Counts Not Applied
Symptoms: Both development and production clusters show same replica count.

Solutions:

Verify kustomization overlay structure
Check patch files are correctly applied
Validate kustomize build locally
# Test kustomize build locally
cd apps/nginx-app/overlays/development
kustomize build .

cd ../production  
kustomize build .
