Key Takeaways
GitOps Benefits: GitOps provides declarative, version-controlled, and auditable application deployment processes
Multi-Cluster Management: RHACM enables centralized management of applications across multiple Kubernetes clusters
Automation: Automated synchronization reduces manual errors and ensures consistency across environments
Observability: ArgoCD provides excellent visibility into application deployment status and health
